### List genres
GET http://localhost:8080/api/genres

### List performers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/performers

### Search performers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/performers?search=aurora

### Get performer details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/performers/1

### List albums
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums

### List albums by performer
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums?performerId=1

### Get album details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/1

### List songs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/songs

### Search songs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/songs?search=love

### List songs by genre
GET http://localhost:8080/api/songs?genreName=Pop

### List songs by performer
GET http://localhost:8080/api/songs?performerId=1

### Get song details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/songs/1

### Nested performer catalog
GET http://localhost:8080/api/performers/1/albums

### Nested performer songs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/performers/1/songs
